; DIMLINEAR (PT26, #713): the dimension takes the current dimension style
; (ISO-25 in a new session), the current layer and the current color.
; The layer record takes handle 257, as in layer/creazione-e-corrente.
; Values by hand from PT23 with ISO-25, as in
; dimlinear/punti-direzione-automatica.
-LAYER
Make
Quote

COLOR
red
DIMLINEAR
0,0
40,0
20,10
